00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.850
Beth: Seeking a diagnosis of Autism
spectrum disorder, can be helpful as

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:08.070
it can give a better understanding
of why a person behaves the way

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:12.390
they do and why they always may have
felt different, therefore working

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.750
to increase their confidence.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.049
Joe: It can give parents and their
child a clear sense of the limitations

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:22.099
and challenges they may face as a
result of the disorder, and help

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:26.380
gain more understanding regarding
behaviour, strengths, needs and

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.980
the appropriate support available.

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:32.540
It can help parents feel more able
to cope with the reactions of others

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.049
to their child and have confidence
in explaining their behaviour, and

00:00:36.049 --> 00:00:39.430
helping them understand that their
child is not just being difficult.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:44.100
Beth: A diagnosis can also help gain
the correct support in all areas,

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:49.089
especially financially if needed, and
in educational settings at all levels.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:54.870
However, support in school is not solely
dependent on a diagnosis, but is based

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:59.690
on individual needs, and some families
may be entitled to benefits such as DLA

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:03.890
if their disability impacts their ability
to function at home or in the community.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:08.759
Joe: If a parent wants a diagnosis and
the child or young person is old enough

00:01:08.809 --> 00:01:12.440
and has the capacity to comprehend the
process, they should be involved in

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:13.900
the decision making where possible.

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:17.940
What needs to be remembered is that
every person is different whether

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:21.630
diagnosed with a disorder or not,
and it is important to consider the

00:01:21.639 --> 00:01:25.699
implications to the people involved, not
just in the present but for the future..

